WEBVTT

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:09.270
We're fighting right now in the galaxy soccer tournament, Grand Celesta Galaxy.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.280
Our first opponent is the planet Sandorias.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:16.950
We continue to fight as we aim to be best in the universe.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.270
The Earth Eleven are battered and bruised from Sandorias's rough plays!

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.670
There's no telling how this match will end!

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.110
Until time is up...

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.920
Don't miss it!

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.710
Outta the way, outta the way!

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.510
Your species isn't all that tough, Earthlings!

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.670
Why, you...!

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.020
Kusaka!

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.760
We're representing Earth!

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.920
Let's fight this fair and square!

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.400
Okay.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.270
Oh yeah!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.180
Sandorias has a one-point lead!

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:39.970
Earth Eleven can't find an opening for a counterattack!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.060
I won't let you through!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.020
Sakura!

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:53.520
Don't fall for the same thing over and over!

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.430
You don't have to talk to me that way!

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.660
Good! Do more!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.000
You're not getting through!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.960
Gara zooms through the defense!

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.090
Again?!

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.800
I'll score it this time!

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:22.910
Hey, defense!

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.430
You're letting them through too easily!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.110
Minaho-kun, mark them properly!

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:29.980
It's not only my fault.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.690
If we don't win, Earth is done for!

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.940
I know that, you don't have to tell me!

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:50.370
They're all making the faces I hate...

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:51.580
Kusaka!

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.880
I can't stand this anymore!

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:08.400
How about I show you what a real headbutt is like?!

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.600
Don't fight!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.950
You're all my friends and I love you!

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.810
You're all such kind people!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:19.190
Don't be annoyed or angry!

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:22.720
Morimura...

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.620
We will win.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:35.420
It was necessary in this match that we feel as if we were in danger.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.350
What do you mean?

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.350
The team is feeling pressured.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:42.590
But it isn't the opponent that is pressuring us.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:45.260
It's Coach Kuroiwa.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.660
The coach drove us into a tight spot on purpose.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.310
He's waiting for this team to awaken to its real power.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.950
Coach.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.650
Please allow me to perform in the match.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.330
Very well.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.660
Change the flow of the game.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.620
I thought you would say that.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:14.620
Oh! Earth Eleven switches out Matatagi for Ichikawa!

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.370
Switch me out?

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.980
Even though Ichikawa's power is unknown, he must be thinking that it can change the flow of this game.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.710
Yeah.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.840
Well, I guess I can agree with that.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.890
Zanakurou, this field is-

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.910
I was watching, so I know already.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:37.120
I'm sorry, but can you give me a moment?

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:41.720
Morimura-san.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:43.400
Yes?

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:48.110
Who do you think is the scariest among the Sandorias Eleven?

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.120
Him and... him.

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:55.740
I see.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:58.830
Then let me advise you on how you can protect everyone.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.510
Think of those two as "It" in a game of tag.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:07.130
Use the ball as if you were playing tag, and keep them from tagging you.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.130
Tag?

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:13.960
By doing so, whoever is "It" will come after you instead of the others.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:16.700
You will be able to protect the others, as a result.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:17.850
Can you do it?

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.860
I can do that...

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.820
But if you're going to do it, you have to mean it.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:28.400
Captain!

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.700
I want to protect everyone!

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:39.870
Just maybe...

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:45.670
The match resumes with the ball in Earth Eleven's possession!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.690
We have to bring out that power Konoha has!

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:49.380
Konoha!

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:56.560
I'll take in everyone's annoyance and anger for them!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.560
Why?! Morimura is heading into Sandorias's field!

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.060
What does that defender think she's doing?!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.360
I'll squash you flat!

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.150
I won't lose!

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.740
I'll protect everyone!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.350
They can use Souls?!

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:26.210
Impossible!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.110
Wow! Morimura brings out a Soul!

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.680
That Soul is from one of Earth's creatures, the fox!

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.280
Soul...

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:38.390
So that's a Soul...

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.260
Soul...

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:44.190
The beast power that lurks inside of me...

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.190
Morimura, over here!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.470
Konoha, center it to him!

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:49.400
O-Okay!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.870
Brutal Head!

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:05.580
Yay! Earth Eleven takes back a point!

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:07.500
We did it, Morimura!

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.760
All right! The first half ends here!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:18.260
We end the first half at a tie of 1-1! Keep on!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.270
Konoha-chan, that was amazing!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.280
I'm surprised, too.

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.930
We managed to tie because of you.

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:26.610
Thanks.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.970
We'll definitely turn the score around!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:29.610
Go for it!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:35.950
You lost a point to those weak Earthlings?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.070
What a disgrace!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:42.040
Listen up! Move exactly the way I tell you to in the second half!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.500
But...

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:50.340
If you don't give me a hand, I guarantee that you will have no future even if you win this!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.380
You don't mean...

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.930
Yay! The second half begins!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.400
I'll stop them!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.020
Destroy the Earthling!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:16.110
Stop! Have you forgotten your Sandorian pride?!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.400
I don't have a choice...

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.290
I don't want to lose!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.210
If we want our planet... our people to survive...

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.170
Do we have no choice but to do whatever it takes to win?

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.930
I'll stop you!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.520
Shindou-san!

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:48.850
I'm okay!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.980
Fall over!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.480
Out of the way!

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:55.030
Take this!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.760
H-He's going overboard...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.240
Stop her!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:05.830
Captain!

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:12.130
Doesn't playing a match like this fill you with disgust?

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:14.800
All I'm doing is fighting fair and square!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.130
Because I don't want to regret it later!

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.480
I'll blow you away!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:32.360
Kazelma!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.820
How dare you get in my way!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:39.600
W-What you're doing is wrong...

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:40.530
What?

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.580
If we can't even protect our own pride... We can't protect anyone!

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.410
You fool!

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:53.420
Mm?! A stormy mood falls over Sandorias!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.750
Is this really how you want to act, everyone?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.470
The match resumes with Kusaka's throw-in!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.020
Shindou receives it and moves up the field!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.480
Crush him!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.710
What's the matter? Do it now!

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:13.470
No.

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:13.980
What?

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.820
I will keep my Sandorian pride!

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:18.650
You guys...

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:19.650
Now!

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:20.860
Tsurugi!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.990
God's Baton: Fire Illusion!

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:28.700
Tenma!

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.080
Okay!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:30.750
Ichikawa!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.570
Sand Knock!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.620
Goal gotten!

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:00.230
Earth Eleven pulls ahead!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.910
You knew about this, didn't you?

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:12.290
He had already awakened to his power, in order to perform the Lion Dance in kabuki.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.500
So that's how you discovered him.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:20.010
The team needed someone to act as the trigger to awaken their beast.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.970
Which was why you needed him on the team.

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:28.720
You little wretches...

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.240
Switch players!

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:40.280
Why?! Barga is leaving the field!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:45.030
This is where our real fight begins!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:46.720
Yeah!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:51.100
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.660
We've become Sparkly men.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.130
That happened rather quickly, yeah?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.480
We were promoted on the spot for the Galaxy cards.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:00.340
See?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.380
OMG SHUT UP.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.670
We're Combo-technique-special men!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.820
Combo-technique-special men?

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:07.770
It's not like that.

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:08.390
Here it is.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.200
SO COOL.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:11.770
Enough with this ugly feuding.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.020
C'mon, Normal man!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:13.970
Don't call me normal!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.110
I can become a special card t-

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:18.280
"Galaxy Cards Version 2 - Shine in Space! Earth Eleven!!"

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.690
Now on sale!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.480
More on...

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.000
The web!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:21.940
HEY!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:26.320
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:32.950
Hey, yo! The second half between Earth Eleven and Sandorias gets intense!

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:34.960
You're not getting through me!

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.210
Dig Through!

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:42.500
Kazelma!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.210
I'll stop you!

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.430
You aren't the only ones with the power of Soul!

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:57.890
Kazelma has a Soul, too!

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:03.320
Dust Javelin!

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.740
Wild Dunk!

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.280
Goal!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.620
Yes!

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:16.960
Kazelma's tying shoot goes in!

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.420
Dig Up!

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:25.670
Kazelma!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.040
I'll stop you!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:29.720
This one's going in!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.390
I'll block you!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.030
Captain!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:53.910
Our passes are carried further on this field.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:54.870
I'll have to bet on that!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:56.490
Tsurugi!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.620
Bicycle Sword!

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:09.050
Sand Knock!

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.340
Goal!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:16.010
Earth Eleven pulls out into the lead once again!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.150
Ozrock.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:21.350
I have an order for you from Falam Orbius's Queen Lalaya.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.470
Sir. Whatever may that be?

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:28.710
There is someone named Kyousuke Tsurugi on the Earth Eleven team.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:30.080
Yes, sir.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.860
She wishes to have him.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.030
Meaning...?

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.790
Bring him to Her Majesty Lalaya.

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.760
I understand and obey.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.970
Yay! That's over!

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.800
The Earth Eleven have won this fierce contest!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:52.620
All right!

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:54.720
We won our first match in space!

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.010
Yeah.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:58.520
Now we've progressed one step ahead.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:02.190
But this will continue to be a hard fight for us.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.270
Yes.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:17.640
That's right...

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.670
The people of this planet are...

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.040
Tenma.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.800
Congratulations on your win.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:26.040
I'm glad we got to fight fair and square.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.710
Yeah...

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.800
But you guys...

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:33.570
We defended our Sandorian pride.

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:35.800
We will accept our fate with dignity.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:38.490
Kazelma...

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:58.530
We won, but I'm left with a bad aftertaste.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:05.570
Winning means taking away hope from other planets.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.830
Even if Earth alone is saved...

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.680
Aoi, hold my bag.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.260
Tenma?

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.260
You <i>did</i>  tell me that I'm responsible for taking care of it.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.200
Wait!

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:56.380
Is this another dream?

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.330
You must have a kind heart.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:02.390
Only very few people can hear my voice.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.970
Who are you?

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.140
Why are you here?

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:09.790
I am Katora, from the planet Kieru.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.070
There is something I must tell you.

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:14.170
Tell me?

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:16.820
There is a way for you to save the galaxy.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.550
Follow me.

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:22.240
I will give you that power.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.790
The power to save everyone.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:26.040
The power to save everyone?

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.710
H-Hey, wait!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.420
I knew it...

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.020
It's the same as what I saw in my dream!

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:56.020
This stone is one of the shards of hope scattered throughout the galaxy. {希望のカケラ...SDR2 reference ww}

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.930
There are four in total.

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:00.220
You must collect them all and come to me.

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.180
Oh, no!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.780
Yeah.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.850
Who's there?

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:25.310
What?

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.360
Play it well.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.630
Just how far did they go?

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.800
Welcome back, Tenma.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:47.250
Good thing you managed to find Pixie.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.820
Is something wrong?

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:50.710
Oh, uh...

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.960
What's that stone?

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.460
Can you tell everyone to come here?

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.000
There's something I have to tell them.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.040
Okay.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:10.130
Babysitting the Queen is a pain, but it worked out rather conveniently for us this time.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.130
I have one other thing to report.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:16.360
Tenma Matsukaze has obtained a shining stone.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:22.360
As I suspected, he has made contact with Princess Katora.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.150
I see.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:28.820
That would make opening this tournament even more significant.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.530
Send them out of Sandorias.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:34.040
Tell the fake Tsurugi to monitor them.

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:35.960
Understood.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:02.570
Katora from the planet Kieru?

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:09.280
I think she tried to reach out to me using some form of transmission or something.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.910
Are you sure you weren't dreaming?

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.590
It wasn't a dream!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:18.380
I could hear Katora's voice and see her clearly.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.420
She must be trying to help us.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.130
This stone has to be a hint to something.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.830
You're wrong.

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:32.050
The planet Kieru that you speak of has long been destroyed.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.980
Receiving contact from there is unthinkable.

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:37.130
Destroyed?

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.440
How would you know that?

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:41.410
Because...

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:45.740
I am from that planet.

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.200
That planet...?

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:52.160
I am an alien.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:27.710
The shocking secret behind Potomuri is at last revealed!

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:29.750
And we move on to our next stage of battle!

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:31.620
We arrive at the water planet!

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:34.220
Next, Warriors Of The Water Planet!

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:36.560
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:49.370
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:55.200
If we can't even protect our own pride, we can't protect anyone!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:56.430
That's all!
